From 786db93120c3fb46c9cd02f267ecb421f1d5add6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:58:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applets/weather: show weather alerts as notifications

Weather alerts were only shown inside the widget's popup, so they went
unseen unless it was opened. Warnings now have a headline and an id that
survives updates, and each new alert is sent once as a notification.

BUG: 517029
